msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I want to thank all my fans! You all so great! Your support mean so much to "
"me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "I am so glad I meet you all! Saranghamnida!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Eeeee! Yu-sama!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Now I must go to other performance. But we meet again someday! Goodbye! "
"Annyeong-higyeseyo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "(He's gone. And I didn't get that damn autograph.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "There you are! Do you have that autograph?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "No. I couldn't get to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Oh, drat. I thought you'd have more luck than another groupie..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Oh well. Thanks to you, I did get a bunch of good shots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"Yu-sama just loves his groupies. Let's keep on being the best fans we can "
"be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Do you have the autograph?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "472"
msgid "You handed over the <Color:8>autograph<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai consegnato la <Color:8>Zappa<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Well done. And here's a little something for all your trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "You got <Color:8>5,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>5.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"You've accomplished something great today! I'd say you're an honorary Yu-"
"sama groupie! Let's keep being the best fans we can be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "Che succede qui?"

msgctxt "652"
msgid "My goodness! Are you a fan of Yu-sama, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Yu-sama?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Don't tell me you've never heard of Yu-sama!? The Korean megastar? Il Yu-"
"Jin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "What planet are you from!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Oh, right. Il Yu-Jin. Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid ""
"Yu-sama's doing a special live performance of \"Winter Gift\" today, here in"
" Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"He'll be coming out soon! But there are a ton of other women trying to hog "
"his attention..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "At this rate, I'll never get his autograph!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"Ooh, I know! How about you get his autograph for me!? I'm sure it'll be fun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "(His autograph, eh...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "If you insist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"I'll pay you for your trouble, of course! All you have to do is take this up"
" and get it signed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "I'll get in position for some nice shots of Yu-sama!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "(Guess I'll go get his autograph.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Get somebody else to do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Eeeeeee! It's Yu-sama!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "Now go and get me that autograph, dear!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "Didn't you hear what I said?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "I'll go snap some photos of him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Uh⑬ Hey!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"(Dammit... Oh, well. I might as well go get her an autograph and be done "
"with it.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"Approach Il Yu-Jin from the front, talk to him, and get his autograph.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Il Yu-Jin is surrounded by his female fans."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"Go get his autograph without bumping into them. Bump into them three times, "
"though, and you'll lose your chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Refuse."
msgstr "Rifiuta"

